.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dnglab-convert 1  "dnglab-convert " 
.SH NAME
dnglab\-convert \- Convert raw image(s) into dng format
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdnglab\-convert\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-compression\fR] [\fB\-\-ljpeg92\-predictor\fR] [\fB\-\-dng\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-dng\-thumbnail\fR] [\fB\-\-embed\-raw\fR] [\fB\-\-artist\fR] [\fB\-\-keep\-mtime\fR] [\fB\-\-image\-index\fR] [\fB\-\-crop\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-override\fR] [\fB\-r\fR|\fB\-\-recursive\fR] [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-jobs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> <\fIOUTPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert raw image(s) into dng format
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-compression\fR \fI<compression>\fR [default: lossless]
Compression for raw image
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
lossless
.IP \(bu 2
uncompressed
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ljpeg92\-predictor\fR \fI<predictor>\fR [default: 1]
LJPEG\-92 predictor
.TP
\fB\-\-dng\-preview\fR \fI<preview>\fR [default: true]
DNG include preview image
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dng\-thumbnail\fR \fI<thumbnail>\fR [default: true]
DNG include thumbnail image
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-embed\-raw\fR \fI<embedded>\fR [default: true]
Embed the raw file into DNG
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-artist\fR \fI<artist>\fR
Set the artist tag
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-mtime\fR \fI<keepmtime>\fR [default: false]
Keep mtime, read from EXIF with fallback to original file mtime
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-image\-index\fR \fI<index>\fR [default: 0]
Select a specific image index (or \*(Aqall\*(Aq) if file is a image container
.TP
\fB\-\-crop\fR \fI<crop>\fR [default: best]
DNG default crop
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
best
.IP \(bu 2
activearea
.IP \(bu 2
none
.RE
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-override\fR
Override existing files
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-recursive\fR
Process input directory recursive
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-jobs\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 0]
Number of files to convert in parallel (0 = auto)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input file or directory
.TP
<\fIOUTPUT\fR>
Output file or existing directory
